OTTO session dataset
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The pretrained rankers in mitate/rankers/ and the OTTO benchmark results in experiments/results/
are derived from the OTTO session dataset by OTTO GmbH & Co KG, licensed under the Creative
Commons Attribution 4.0 International License (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/).
Dataset: https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/otto/recsys-dataset, DOI 10.34740/KAGGLE/DSV/4991874.

Changes made: stores were sampled from the sessions (bench/simulator.py), and the rankers were
trained on the validation windows of those stores. The dataset itself is not redistributed here.

